      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "By the judgment dated 04/05.10.2023 passed by learned Special Judge, POCSO/ Addl.\nSessions Judge/FTC, Haldwani, Nainital in S.S.T. No.55 of 2020, appellant has been convicted under Sections 363, 366, 376(2)(n), 376(a)(b) IPC and Section 5(l)(m) of the POCSO Act, 2012, but sentenced him as under: -\nS. Conviction Sentence Fine Sentence in-lieu No. of fine 1. 363 IPC Five years' Rs.10,000/- Six months' R.I. additional imprisonment 2. 366 IPC Five years' Rs.10,000/- Six months' R.I. additional imprisonment 3. 5(l)(m)/6 Twenty Rs.20,000/- One year of POCSO years' R.I. additional Act imprisonment The aforesaid sentences were directed to run concurrently.",
